         <gmd:abstract>
            <gco:CharacterString>This raster layer represents the identified hazard zones for the Berchtesgaden region. The analysis is derived from environmental datasets, including the multi-temporal Digital Elevation Model (DEM) sourced from airborne LiDAR surveys conducted in Austria and Germany between 2008 and 2024</gco:CharacterString>
         </gmd:abstract>
